# 🎛️ Realistic CSS Switch

A modern and realistic **toggle switch UI component** created using HTML and CSS.

## 🌐 Website

[Uiverse – Realistic Switch](https://uiverse.io/elijahgummer/light-jellyfish-4)

## 📌 About

This project is inspired by a realistic switch component available on **Uiverse.io**.

The component demonstrates how HTML and CSS can be used to create an attractive and interactive toggle switch without requiring JavaScript.

It uses a modern dark interface with realistic styling, glow effects, and a clean minimal design.

## ✨ Features

* 🎛️ Realistic toggle switch
* 🎨 Modern UI design
* 🌑 Dark theme
* 💡 Glow effect
* ⚡ CSS-based interaction
* 📱 Responsive design
* 🧩 Reusable component
* 🎯 Minimal interface
* 💻 HTML and CSS implementation
* ✨ Smooth visual effects

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* CSS Transitions
* CSS Transform
* CSS Pseudo-elements
* CSS Selectors
* CSS Effects

