## 🎯 Learning Purpose

This project is useful for learning how to create interactive UI components using CSS.

It helps beginners understand:

* HTML input elements
* CSS selectors
* Toggle switches
* CSS transitions
* CSS transformations
* Glow effects
* Shadows
* Responsive UI
* Modern interface design

## 🚀 Why Use This Component?

A toggle switch provides users with a simple way to turn an option ON or OFF.

The realistic styling makes the interface more attractive while keeping the component simple and reusable.

